flowchart TD
    PULL[DVC pull] --> TEST[Run fast tests]
    TEST --> CHANGE[Change code or config]
    CHANGE --> TRAIN[Train and log to MLflow]
    TRAIN --> VERIFY[Run slow golden test]
    VERIFY --> PUSH[DVC add and push]
    PUSH --> REVIEW[Review MLflow and drift]
    REVIEW -. next change .-> CHANGE

    classDef prepare fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#b45309,color:#111827
    classDef action fill:#dbeafe,stroke:#1d4ed8,color:#111827
    classDef gate fill:#fee2e2,stroke:#b91c1c,color:#111827
    classDef result fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#15803d,color:#111827
    class PULL prepare
    class TEST,CHANGE,TRAIN,PUSH action
    class VERIFY gate
    class REVIEW result
